 equals the average of the maximum and minimum values. \n\nIn our case, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{y}_{\\text{min}}+{y}_{\\text{max}}}{2} & =\\frac{\\frac{19}{3}+\\frac{41}{6}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\frac{38}{6}+\\frac{41}{6}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\frac{79}{6}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{79}{12}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the midline is $y=\\frac{79}{12}.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186528269 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "80ca3c99-5201-53fc-b3ff-84018330df5a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y=-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186528247} {:answer/id #uuid "949bbceb-e772-5dd8-8d22-072e25711052" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y=\\frac{15}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186528252} {:answer/id #uuid "abb47660-35bd-50c6-98f1-55ce4f0a38d4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y=\\frac{17}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186528262} {:answer/id #uuid "b066b147-5432-52c3-bbc6-609ea744da6e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y=15" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186528265} {:answer/id #uuid "e64504bb-cb72-53fd-9fb5-9155d0bf84de" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y=16" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186528286}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "949bbceb-e772-5dd8-8d22-072e25711052" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y=\\frac{15}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186528252} :answer-field/id #uuid "a552a765-c76b-5294-93f0-abdfd73fe5a7" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186528256}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "bd96626f-1c04-5891-b924-ae389571950b" :question/problem "Find the equation of the midline for a transformed cosine function with a minimum value of $-1$ and a maximum value of $16.$" :question/worked-solution "A sinusoidal graph's midline (or vertical shift) is the horizontal line that divides it vertically in half. \n\nThe equation of the midline is given by\n\n$$\ny=\\frac{{y}_{\\text{min}}+{y}_{\\text{max}}}{2},\n$$\n\nwhere ${y}_{\\text{min}}$ and ${y}_{\\text{max}}$ are the minimum and maximum values of the function. The midline equals the average of the maximum and minimum values. \n\nIn our case, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{y}_{\\text{min}}+{y}_{\\text{max}}}{2} & =\\frac{-1+16}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{15}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{15}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the midline is $y=\\frac{15}{2}.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186528273 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6fcfc5d3-45b1-56e9-8bbc-d7751a85e586" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y=- \\frac{19}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186528242} {:answer/id #uuid "7f2f6e28-b301-50f8-8886-d7dd96f10d31" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y=\\frac{9}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186528246} {:answer/id #uuid "93b9e714-df26-5d8c-bc9b-266c87d2634b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y=-14" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186528251} {:answer/id #uuid "c00a140a-956c-5f02-a63b-d6885ee6c245" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y=-19" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186528270} {:answer/id #uuid "dd032ab2-2edf-5498-bed4-3c270050fd07" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y=-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186528279}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6fcfc5d3-45b1-56e9-8bbc-d7751a85e586" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y=- \\frac{19}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186528242} :answer-field/id #uuid "b46baf5