fect on the range. Therefore,\n\n$$\n-1\\le \\sin(2x+1)\\le 1.\n$$\n\nMultiplying the above inequality by $-3$ and then adding $2$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & -1\\le \\sin(2x+1)\\le 1 \\\\  & 3\\ge -3\\sin(2x+1)\\ge -3 \\\\  & 5\\ge -3\\sin(2x+1)+2\\ge -1 \\\\  & -1\\le f(x)\\le 5.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the minimum value is $-1.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186531882 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "058c4a02-5842-5f2f-b56c-8ffbb80c91a9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y\\in [- \\frac{13}{3},- \\frac{7}{3}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186531862} {:answer/id #uuid "21ca9ef2-6c80-542c-a8ae-e2e9771fbb05" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y\\in [- \\frac{101}{6},\\frac{61}{6}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186531865} {:answer/id #uuid "47bb1d33-4b81-5a51-84fd-d4dd865d6da1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y\\in [- \\frac{7}{6},\\frac{47}{6}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186531877} {:answer/id #uuid "77ee29f0-d812-52a5-8b80-8da9d568e6d7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y\\in [- \\frac{9}{2},\\frac{9}{2}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186531886} {:answer/id #uuid "fcc26598-de2b-53ff-b631-30e455b08647" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y\\in [- \\frac{47}{6},\\frac{7}{6}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186531926}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "fcc26598-de2b-53ff-b631-30e455b08647" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y\\in [- \\frac{47}{6},\\frac{7}{6}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186531926} :answer-field/id #uuid "7dcead1a-e49d-5054-9922-d19274e9f742" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186531888}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb