s(5x-2)\\le 1.\n$$\n\nMultiplying the above inequality by $- \\frac{5}{2}$ and then subtracting $\\frac{11}{2}$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & -1\\le \\cos(5x-2)\\le 1 \\\\  & \\frac{5}{2}\\ge - \\frac{5}{2}\\cos(5x-2)\\ge - \\frac{5}{2} \\\\  & -3\\ge - \\frac{5}{2}\\cos(5x-2)-\\frac{11}{2}\\ge -8 \\\\  & -8\\le f(x)\\le -3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the minimum value is $-8.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186532783 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "057f6cc1-1b70-5f31-acf5-c6d5e1397520" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2\\pi }{7}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186532786} {:answer/id #uuid "16548f69-9c02-5678-a13e-84e218285606" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{8\\pi }{7}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186532793} {:answer/id #uuid "e2687037-aacb-5f64-a8e5-62d0ee905c3d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\pi" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186532846} {:answer/id #uuid "e7c504b0-9aaf-5d90-a3d2-95fec9feae52" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{4\\pi }{7}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186532849} {:answer/id #uuid "ea7b756f-9870-58bc-a361-ca58301061f0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7\\pi" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186532850}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e7c504b0-9aaf-5d90-a3d2-95fec9feae52" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{4\\pi }{7}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186532849} :answer-field/id #uuid "5e50ee60-0bbe-5f0a-ba30-562fe65435ca" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186532811}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "0171ada0-2759-535e-9da0-835934d5cf30" :question/problem "C